{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_yak_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_yak_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"一天","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_yak_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"9e1006883668212008041c44f9c08f750add6e8813f8db4201a0ddd1d3334f6e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"平静的一天里，角峰似乎在等待着什么。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"角峰"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g9_manoravenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩A","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走过看一看，瞧一瞧啊，新鲜的蔬菜与水果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，老爷子，那不是耶克家的小子吗？好久都不见他来这集市了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩A","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么呢，那孩子现在是领主家的护卫，怎么可能有时间来逛市场啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿伯，好久不见了，身体怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩A","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀呀，还真的是你啊，马特洪。嗨，你这小子怎么今天得空来我们这里啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近几天空下来了，想着也该为老爷做顿晚饭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是就是，你那个厨艺可不能荒废了。来来，这条肉排你拿去，记得老爷小时候最爱吃，你每次来都是提一兜子才走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您的好意了，不过还是先称五斤里脊肉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩A","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那个时候二小姐也还是小姑娘，你出来买菜她总跟在你屁股后面，小手就拽着你的衣角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，恩希亚小姐那时候还小，好奇心重，在家里待不住，就带出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，里脊切好了，给你。欸，是老爷他口味变了，不爱吃小排了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，老爷他......长大了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩A","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马特洪啊，大小姐，不对不对，看我这糊涂脑袋，圣女大人近来好不好？咱们......都惦念着她呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣女大人她......身体安康，一切都还好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉冈德庇佑着圣女大人，定会诸事顺遂的，老爷子宽心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是多亏了圣女大人在危急时刻出现稳定了局面，咱们这小日子才能继续往下过啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣女大人冰雪聪明，危机当前尚能沉着应对，更不会被其他事难倒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩A","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，圣女大人与老爷兄妹齐心，咱们日后只会更好的，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（若真如此便好了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩A","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，一转眼你们都这么大了，这日子啊，过得可真快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可不是，你们长大了，大娘我也老了，还是年轻的时候好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您现在还和从前一样容光焕发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，数你嘴甜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，想什么呢，皱着个眉头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大娘......我想了想，还是给我称些小排吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，等着啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你，这些够吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，谢谢您。应该是这么多钱吧，我就放在桌子上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，还是你们年轻人算得快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，大娘，阿伯，我先回去了，这时候厨房里该开始准备晚餐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩B","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，快去吧，别耽误了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩A","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空常来啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔......是角峰叔，他怎么站在这里一动不动的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是很难了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰叔，你端着盘子站在过道里嘀嘀咕咕什么呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说今天要找极光他们在外面吃晚饭吗，还没有出发？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这会儿还早呢，不着急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，晚餐这么丰盛，今天家里有客人来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，只是老爷今天难得回家用晚餐，我也正好有空，主动要求下厨做两道菜而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不止两道菜啊。我看看......还有我最爱吃的烩肉哎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办，不想出去吃了，感觉在家里和老哥一起吃顿晚饭也不错啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那恩希亚小姐就留在家里吃吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐还想吃什么？我再去烧几道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了不了，角峰叔你太夸张了！这些菜已经足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好，恩希亚小姐您先稍作等待，厨房里还有一道汤在炖着，我一会儿端过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先去洗手啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这、二小姐也在的话......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一会儿......怎么好和老爷开口呢？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚小姐，汤为您端上来了，要先——呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰大哥，晚上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯，怎么只有你来了，老爷没回来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讯使哥刚刚告诉我，老哥有急事，估计不能回来吃晚饭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐别太难过，事情来得突然，老爷也是不得已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吗......要不，我们再等等老爷，说不定晚些时候还会回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰大哥......借一步说话可以吗?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是有什么不能当着恩希亚小姐的面说吗？非得要我避开来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰大哥，我想着，要不你还是别等了......你也知道，老爷忙起来就什么都顾不上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，魏斯，我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰大哥！劝你一句，别等了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许老爷晚归......就已经是给了大哥你答复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况这答案，心细如大哥你，应该早已......明了了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，我知道了。对了，前几天我熏了些肉干，一会儿去厨房给你包些，你带着当零嘴吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥你......果然还是不愿接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过还是谢谢你的好意了，大哥。但是我最近受了点伤，医生嘱咐我要忌口，所以只好心领了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯你受伤了？！在哪里？医生怎么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一点小伤而已，不是什么大事，不必再让角峰大哥担心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么不和我说呢？现在你有事总瞒着我，才是最让我担心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，从小到大，每次受伤都让大哥你操心。现在大了，再让你操心，多难为情啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......你现在也大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......角峰大哥，我还有事......就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等下，魏斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在口袋中摸索）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥，你在找什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你，拿着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......雪酥糖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上路过糖铺的时候买的，你小时候每次训练受伤都会告诉我，缠着我要些雪酥糖吃。我还害怕你吃坏牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果你这家伙现在不管我要了，大哥我竟然有点不习惯，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰大哥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拆开糖纸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥......你之后还有空吗？等我伤好了......就一起去酒馆喝一杯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，看你时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"讯使","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那大哥，我先走了，回见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰叔，讯使哥怎么说？老哥今晚还回来吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚小姐，您先吃吧，老爷估计很晚才能回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，果然是这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那角峰叔你也坐下来一起吃吧，我一个人吃饭不香的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，好，恩希亚小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先喝碗肉汤吧，大骨头吊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶溜——好浓郁的味道啊，角峰叔，你的手艺真是没的说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，二小姐可以再尝尝这块炭烤小排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呜啊呜，好吃好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐慢点吃，别噎着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呜，角峰叔你也快吃啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（二小姐今天吃得很香啊，看她前几天胃口不好的样子，还以为......看来是我多虑了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰叔，那个蹄筋炖得好软糯，再给我来一个吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，给您端过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再喝碗汤，里面的肉丸很入味，超好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐......您这，还能吃下吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没吃饱呢，角峰叔，再来一碗土豆泥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐还没吃饱？这已经是第三碗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（二小姐她已经吃了远超自己食量的食物......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咀嚼）你做的菜......太美味了嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（努力吞咽）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（捂嘴）不好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗝呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚小姐......吃不下的话，就算了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我......好像是有点饱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是、可是还剩了好多啊，角峰叔费心思做了这么多，剩下的话，实在太对不起你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是如果恩希亚小姐因此撑坏了肚子，我也会不好受啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要恩希亚小姐您能带着愉悦的笑容享受美食，我就能满足了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，可是，要是老哥也在，就能吃完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐是因为没有等到老爷，所以感到有些沮丧吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，好久都没和老哥一起面对面吃晚饭了。早上他匆匆就走了，晚上又很晚才到家，一天到晚和他连面都见不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，我偷跑去见姐姐，打乱了老哥的安排，应该是真的惹他动怒了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐......并没有做错什么，老爷他......不会怪罪您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰叔，要是还能有那么一天就好了，大家说说笑笑，再聚在饭桌旁享用你的拿手菜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚小姐......请不要担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直都在的，只要您想吃，我随时为您准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论......将来发生了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......角峰叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天色不早了，恩希亚小姐早些休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，角峰叔你也早点休息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（收拾桌子上的碗碟）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——该如何是好啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，您回来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰你......一直等到这么晚吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是让讯使回来说过，今天有急事，我不回来用晚餐了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想着老爷您总是忙得顾不上吃饭，可能饿着肚子就回来了，所以我就决定再等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，家里还有什么吃的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷您想吃什么，我现做几道您爱吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，晚饭热一热端上来就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......不好吧。毕竟是些残羹剩饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，恩希亚今天没有出去吃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐听说老爷今晚会回来，特意留下来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，明天我会早些回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"属下明白了，那今晚您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正是恩希亚吃过的，不妨事，端上来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，老爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g10_manorhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，今晚备下的晚餐就是这些了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做了很多，角峰你费心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是属下应该的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是刚刚一时不慎，打碎了盘子，割到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去擦些药吧，好得快些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，老爷，一会儿就去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......炭烤小排？好久没吃过这道菜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷要尝尝吗？还是按着您从前喜欢的口味做的，一点儿也没变。"},{"type":"narration","text":"言毕，角峰感受到银灰的视线在自己身上扫了个来回，他突然心慌，好像那些自己藏在腹中的话，被银灰如炬的目光彻底洞察清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，给我盛一碗肉汤吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是，稍等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻抿一口）很鲜，你的手艺一直很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷吃着舒心就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还做了烩兽肉，恩希亚一直最爱吃这个，难怪留得不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚小姐她......今天下午等了您很久，心里一直很忐忑，害怕老爷您会因为当时的事责怪她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对恩希亚的事一向很上心。也是，她年纪最小，你难免操心她多些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃过再说吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"餐厅内，银灰没再说话，只有轻微的咀嚼声在空气中反复响起。角峰的喉头几次滚动，也没能吐出，哪怕只言片语。\n终于，银灰放下手中的餐具，拿起餐巾拭了拭嘴角。虽然心里打着鼓，角峰还是抬起了头，准备看向银灰的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这汤煲了多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大差不差，有一天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一天，也就你能耐得住性子等一天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷过奖了，这些事情都急不来的，人急了，汤就不好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那汤在炉火上滚着，溢出来怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"心细些煨汤，不会溢出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，可一直小心翼翼煨着，汤也不会好。时候到了还是要当机立断把火灭掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷说的不错，确实是这个道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，角峰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，属下......已经决定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，角峰，以后......便不必再听命于我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老爷也是希望我全职卫护在二小姐的身边吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，比起我，现在恩希亚更需要你的卫护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若老爷有需要，属下还是会随时为您效力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不要。你不仅要全职卫护恩希亚的安全，更要全心全意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷的指令，属下必然遵守。可我还是不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷......是何时做出这样的决定的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰，我们是从何时相识的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从您还在襁褓中时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么久了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶克家族世代为领主效力，这是我身为领主家的护卫与生俱来的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"护卫......角峰，恩雅与恩希亚都视你为家人，你还坚持如此自称吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，属下从不敢僭越。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不必惶恐。我不是问你，只是说句实话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从维多利亚回来后，事情桩桩件件压下来，角峰，你确实有些难处，能看出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劳烦老爷您挂心了，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是老爷与恩雅、恩希亚小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，恩雅与恩希亚，有你照顾着，我也能安心许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷这些年受苦了，是属下不能及时替您分忧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......角峰，我的两个妹妹，你无论如何都要保护她们周全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"属下定然不惜性命也会坚守在恩雅与恩希亚小姐身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会记着这话的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你先下去吧，我要休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马特洪——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您还有什么吩咐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，只是......谢谢这些年......你在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早些休息吧，不要太劳累......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
